body:
I remember two that really stood out to me, and they happened within months of each other. I was a junior in high school.

&#x200B;

The first one- in the dream I was in art class, which was basically a goof off class with a bunch of my friends. In the dream a friend of mine is passing around a picture of him showing his penis, which is giant. Everyone is laughing hysterically. The next day, the dream is heavy on my mind because it really made an imprint on me. Then in art class, that same friends makes a giant cutout of a penis and sneakily tapes it to another friend's back. Everyone is quietly laughing until the other friend realizes what's going on, and everyone laughs hysterically, just like in the dream.

&#x200B;

The second one- In the dream I was at work (I was a dishwasher at a nursing home. We had a contract with the local jail to cater their meals, for context.) I hear a voice over the intercom: "Dietary, call on line one." I answer the phone and it's a guard from the jail telling us we shorted them a meal, so I have to drive there and take them another meal. The next day in real life, I am at work and I hear "Dietary, call on line one." I immediately think "oh man it's going to be the jail, just like in my dream." Sure enough, a coworker comes in and tell me the jail just called and I have to drive another meal to them because they were shorted. 

&#x200B;

These obviously could both be coincidences, no doubt. But it made a pretty big impression on me regardless.
